    excerpt: "How hearth technicians generate leads for wood and pellet stove repair, typical pricing, and how seasonal demand shapes this specialized trade.",
    metaDescription: "How wood and pellet stove repair technicians generate leads, typical pricing, and how strongly seasonal demand shapes this specialized trade.",
    category: "Home Services Marketing",
    readTime: "6 min read",
